,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布Muse Spark个人超级智能模型，实现10倍算力优化与多Agent协同</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布最强模型Claude Mythos，百万Token输出定价125美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布自研转录模型 MAI-Transcribe-1，平均字错误率低至 3.9%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米开源OmniVoice多语言TTS模型：支持600+语种，中文WER仅0.84%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2641898065be4413cddbc91d7bae1257.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米下一代Kaldi团队（k2-fsa）正式开源OmniVoice，这是一款支持超过600种语言的超大规模多语言零样本文本转语音（TTS）模型。该模型采用扩散语言模型风格的离散非自回归架构，可直接从文本一步生成语音。性能方面，OmniVoice在Seed-TTS中文测试集上的词错误率（WER）低至0.84%，多语言基准测试指标超越ElevenLabs v2和MiniMax。其实时因子（RTF）低至0.025，合成速度比实时快40倍。OmniVoice支持3-10秒短参考音频的零样本语音克隆，并允许通过自然语言描述自定义性别、年龄、口音等属性，同时支持处理笑声等非语言符号及拼音发音纠正。该模型已在GitHub和Hugging Face开源，为小语种及濒危语言的数字化保护提供了高效解决方案，开发者可进行本地部署或集</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">宇树科技新款人形机器人R1现身阿里园区，双方合作项目树卖通浮出水面</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c5ed16b17dd8286e16cbad8b341e2496.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月9日，宇树科技（Unitree）最新款人形机器人R1在阿里巴巴西溪园区亮相，标志着双方合作项目“树卖通”正式进入预热阶段。现场R1机器人展示了拟人化操作电脑的动作，该项目计划于4月中旬在深圳品牌大会上正式官宣。行业分析认为，“树卖通”项目指向宇树科技与阿里旗下跨境电商平台AliExpress的深度业务整合，双方合作将从早期的线上入驻升级为战略协同。此次合作旨在利用AliExpress成熟的全球物流与营销体系，降低国产人形机器人出海门槛，提升其在全球民用及商用市场的渗透率。对于行业而言，这是具身智能与跨境电商生态结合的创新尝试，电商平台正通过引入前沿AI硬件，构建更具差异化的跨境贸易服务体系。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布Muse Spark个人超级智能模型，实现10倍算力优化与多Agent协同</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d0fa4295a7fc9ee150380d25457f759f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布Muse系列首款个人超级智能模型Muse Spark，现已上线Meta.ai官网及移动端。该模型采用原生多模态架构，支持深度推理、工具调用及视觉思维链。核心亮点包括：Contemplating模式采用多Agent并行推理，在Humanity&#x27;s Last Exam基准测试中取得58%成绩；计算效率实现突破，同等性能下算力消耗仅为Llama4Maverick的1/10。在视觉与专业领域，Muse Spark具备强大的实体识别能力，如拍照自动生成数独；通过与1000多名医生联合训练，模型可提供专业健康分析，通过红绿点标注直观反馈饮食建议。目前，Meta已同步启动Muse Spark的私有API预览，后续将持续迭代以强化个人超级智能定位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布最强模型Claude Mythos，百万Token输出定价125美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/19eac7cf8de7d3a828a9704bb12670da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布AI模型Claude Mythos，其定价策略引发行业关注，输出价格高达125美元/百万Token，输入价格为25美元/百万Token，较Claude Sonnet 4.6贵约8倍。由于成本极高，该模型暂未向普通用户开放。面对高昂资费，GitHub项目“caveman”通过强制模型去除客套话、仅保留核心术语的“山顶洞人语”模式，成功节省约65%的Token，且在部分基准测试中准确率提升26%。开发者社区总结了多种降本策略，包括利用“编辑”功能修改提示词、定期开启新对话以避免上下文堆叠、将长文档上传至Projects利用缓存，以及根据任务复杂度在Haiku与Mythos模型间进行按需降级使用。这些实践标志着AI交互正从“大手大脚”转向“字斟句酌”的精细化运营时代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布自研转录模型 MAI-Transcribe-1，平均字错误率低至 3.9%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d3f8f89362d9e914c2e3c3ddc370e7b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于4月2日正式发布自研AI转录模型MAI-Transcribe-1，在FLEURS基准测试中实现3.9%的平均字错误率，号称全球最精准。该模型覆盖全球25种主要语言，在11种核心语言中位居榜首，并在多项对比中超越OpenAI的Whisper-large-v3及谷歌Gemini 3.1 Flash。性能方面，其批量转录速度达到Microsoft Azure Fast服务的2.5倍，定价为每小时0.36美元，具备极高性价比。目前，MAI-Transcribe-1已在Microsoft Foundry平台开放使用。微软官方表示，该模型旨在满足多样化语音转文字需求，虽首发版本暂不支持实时转录、说话人分离及偏见调整功能，但后续将通过更新迭代补齐上述能力。此举标志着微软在语音AI领域进一步完善其自研模型版图，为企业级用</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
